      "first": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 1,
        "text": "What about a piece on Lombardi -- on Staten Island -- corruption bombs are going off around that guy and he's Mr. Clean. You know he's got his hands where they don't belong --"
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 0,
        "line": 841,
        "text": "The streets here can be hard and rough and the justice meted out isn't always the kind taught in school. The court- of-the-street found Fast Black guilty even if the court of law did not."
